#: app/src/host_ui/qc.rs:195
msgid ""
"Blue: pen marks. Orange: possible folds (tissue much darker than the rest). "
"Yellow: possibly out of focus (tissue without fine detail, such as fibrin or "
"necrosis, can be marked too). The thresholds are relative to this slide; the "
"marks are for review, not measurements."
msgstr ""
"Modro: oznake s flomastrom. Oranžno: morebitne gube (tkivo, precej temnejše "
"od preostalega). Rumeno: morda neostro (označeno je lahko tudi tkivo brez "
"finih podrobnosti, na primer fibrin ali nekroza). Pragovi so relativni glede "
"na ta preparat; oznake so namenjene pregledu in niso meritve."

